menu "sys_session"

    config SYS_SESSION_MAX
        int "Sessions"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          Providers attached to a peer: the board's clients.

    config SYS_SESSION_GONE_LISTENERS
        int "Gone-peer listeners"
        default 5
        range 1 8
        help
          sys_session_on_gone and sys_session_on_reached slots, each: the
          connectors, the dead-man.

    config SYS_SESSION_STREAM_LISTENERS
        int "Stream listeners"
        default 2
        range 1 4
        help
          sys_session_on_stream slots.

    #@limit @alias Session timeout @unit ms
    config SYS_SESSION_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Session timeout (ms)"
        default 3000
        range 150 60000
        help
          A client's session with nothing received for this long ends: its
          peer is gone, the hello starts again. The hello tells the peer,
          which sends at least every third of it. The dead-man's time replaces
          it while armed (sys_session_set_timeout).

endmenu
